        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 的可执行文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "睡眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stream from a virtual display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从虚拟显示器串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streamed where it is: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在原位置串流：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "串流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在串流到 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming with the software encoder, up to 60 fps, until it is free again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在使用软件编码器串流（最高 60 fps），直到硬件编码器空闲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming with the software encoder, up to 60 fps. Restarting the Mac fixes this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在使用软件编码器串流（最高 60 fps）。重新启动 Mac 即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Pattern": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试图案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Pattern Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试图案模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text you copy here can be pasted on a connected iPhone or iPad, and text sent from one with Paste becomes this Mac’s.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这里拷贝的文本可以粘贴到已连接的 iPhone 或 iPad 上；从设备通过“粘贴”发送的文本也会进入这台 Mac 的剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn’t look like an address. Try home.example.net, or home.example.net:17455.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这看起来不像地址。请尝试 home.example.net 或 home.example.net:17455。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac keeps playing it too": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 也会继续播放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The devices you pair in Devices can connect from afar while Remote Access is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远程访问打开时，你在“设备”中配对的设备可以从远处连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardware encoder is busy or not answering, so streams use the software encoder: up to 60 fps at Standard resolution. Sill switches back by itself once it keeps up again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器繁忙或无响应，因此串流改用软件编码器：标准分辨率下最高 60 fps。硬件编码器恢复后，Sill 会自动切换回去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardware encoder is stuck, so streams use the software encoder: up to 60 fps at Standard resolution. Restarting the Mac fixes this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件编码器卡住了，因此串流改用软件编码器：标准分辨率下最高 60 fps。重新启动 Mac 即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link can’t carry %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前链路带不动“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The login item and the permissions follow this copy of Sill. Keep one copy, in Applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录项和权限都跟随这一份 Sill。请只保留一份，并放在“应用程序”文件夹中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@, so devices on the network cannot connect. In Terminal:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了%@，因此网络中的设备无法连接。请在“终端”中运行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections, so devices on the network cannot connect. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接，因此网络中的设备无法连接。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The macOS firewall blocks all incoming connections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 防火墙阻止了所有传入连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The streamed window is on the virtual display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所串流的窗口在虚拟显示器上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can’t be reached while it’s asleep. While a device is connected from away, Sill keeps it from going to sleep by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 睡眠时无法访问。有设备从远程连接时，Sill 会阻止它自动睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of Sill has no version number, so it can’t check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本的 Sill 没有版本号，因此无法检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配对码已过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code no longer works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此配对码已失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the Mac’s name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是这台 Mac 的名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This network. Use it with a VPN into your home network, such as WireGuard on your router.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此网络。配合连回家庭网络的 VPN 使用，例如路由器上的 WireGuard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Remote Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开远程访问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off Block all incoming connections in System Settings › Network › Firewall › Options.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“系统设置 › 网络 › 防火墙 › 选项”中关闭“阻止所有传入连接”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn this on to pair while you use this Mac through Screen Sharing or another remote desktop app, as you would a Mac without a display. While it’s on, anyone who can see this Mac’s screen remotely can read the code. Devices streaming this Mac never show the window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你通过屏幕共享或其他远程桌面 App 使用这台 Mac（比如没有接显示器的 Mac），打开此项即可配对。打开期间，任何能远程看到这台 Mac 屏幕的人都能读到配对码。正在串流这台 Mac 的设备永远不会显示该窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultra": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable: the keychain couldn’t be used": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用：无法使用钥匙串"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock this Mac, then tap it on the %@ again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先解锁这台 Mac，然后在 %@ 上再轻点一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to %lld fps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高 %lld fps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses a private macOS interface (CGVirtualDisplay). If a macOS update breaks it, Sill streams the window where it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用了 macOS 私有接口（CGVirtualDisplay）。如果 macOS 更新导致它失效，Sill 会在窗口原位置串流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual Display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "虚拟显示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visible on your network as": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在网络上显示为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the Network": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待网络"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your approval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待你批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole Desktop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整个桌面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi‑Fi": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi‑Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works once, for the next %lld:%@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅可使用一次，剩余 %1$lld:%2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works only if your router lets incoming IPv6 connections reach this Mac; most don’t.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅当路由器允许传入的 IPv6 连接到达这台 Mac 时才有效；大多数路由器不允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have %@; opens its download page": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你当前是 %@；将打开下载页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your devices can’t reach this Mac through %@ until it connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 连接之前，你的设备无法通过它访问这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your devices learn these when they pair and keep them current whenever they connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备会在配对时获知这些地址，并在每次连接时保持更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your internet provider shares this address among many homes (%@), so a port forward can’t reach this Mac. Use a VPN such as Tailscale instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的网络运营商让许多家庭共用这个地址（%@），因此端口转发无法到达这台 Mac。请改用 Tailscale 之类的 VPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your paired devices show here once Sill can use its key again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 能重新使用密钥后，已配对设备会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your router didn’t say. You’ll find the address in its settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器没有告知。你可以在路由器设置中找到该地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your router sits behind another router. Forward the port on both, or use a VPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的路由器位于另一台路由器之后。请在两台路由器上都转发端口，或使用 VPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set. Open Sill on your iPhone or iPad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一切就绪。请在 iPhone 或 iPad 上打开 Sill。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一台设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "at home": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在家中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "by address": {
